  <li><strong>Cache expiration and eviction.</strong> Choosing a TTL, how Redis expires keys, and how its eviction policies decide what to remove.</li>
  <li><strong>Cache invalidation and consistency.</strong> The races that leave stale data behind, and how to prevent them.</li>
  <li><strong>Cache stampedes and the thundering herd.</strong> Why many simultaneous misses for one key overload a database, and how to prevent them.</li>
